mmuter Center | Armstrong Student Center | Miami University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"For students commuting to the Oxford campus; listed availability is 7 a.m.–7 p.m. and the center closes during specified university breaks and summer closure.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"king-library-makerspace","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Makerspace at King Library","title":"Makerspace at King Library","subtitle":"King Library · third floor","notes":"Bring a project that benefits from making or digital media work, then use the hands-on equipment and ask staff for guidance on available tools.","short_summary":"A collaborative experiential-learning space with fabrication, media, and digital-creation equipment.","evidence_claim":"King Library’s third-floor Makerspace is a hands-on, collaborative, experiential learning space with 3D printers, CNC mills, sewing machines, VR headsets, and other equipment.","source_url":"https://lib.miamioh.edu/use/spaces/computer-labs/","source_title":"Computer Availability | Miami University Libraries","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Located on King Library’s third floor. Check current library guidance for equipment availability and any required training or appointments.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
